(1) The City of Calhoun adopts all Georgia State Minimum Codes as set out in O.C.G.A. § 8-2-20 (9)(A) and (B) by reference as though they were copied fully in this section except as modified or restricted by the following specifically adopted versions of the international codes provided below:
a. 2024 International Building Code with Georgia Amendments;
